## Summary
Nvidia has released Ray Reconstruction for DLSS 4.5 on August 25th, aiming to improve ray-traced and path-traced shadow rendering and lighting accuracy compared to previous versions.

## Key Points
- Nvidia released DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction on August 25th
- The update aims to more accurately render ray-traced and path-traced shadows and lighting
- Improvements over previous Ray Reconstruction versions in visual quality
- Notably highlighted improvement includes more accurate illumination rendering of objects like trash bags


